      {
        "key": "重華疊霜",
        "title": "重華疊霜",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/12/02/292125737/f17b48b7b6d0a06e1b0ad5fa0799168b_7508657615778912363.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd780>元素戰技</color>\n造成3點 <color=#99ffff>冰元素傷害</color> ，生成 <color=#ffffff>重華疊霜領域</color> 。\n<color=#ffffff>重華疊霜領域</color>\n<color=#ffd780>出戰狀態</color>\n我方單手劍、雙手劍或長柄武器角色造成的 <color=#ffffff>物理傷害</color> 變為 <color=#99ffff>冰元素傷害</color> 。\n<color=#ffffff>持續回合：2</color>"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "雲開星落",
        "title": "雲開星落",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/12/02/292125737/d98d17703b86282b89569cb7c5dde12c_7297898323337699789.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd780>元素爆發</color>\n造成7點 <color=#99ffff>冰元素傷害</color> 。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "冰元素傷害",
        "title": "冰元素傷害",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/01/21/84496276/4bcc4b82a9d7ee22770f60afa54e9919_6866617370129361137.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "附著冰元素，可發生元素反應：\n【 <color=#99ffff>冰元素</color> + <color=#ff9999>火元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>融化</color> ：本傷害+2\n【 <color=#99ffff>冰元素</color> + <color=#ffacff>雷元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>超導</color> ：本傷害+1，對目標以外的所有敵方角色造成1點穿透傷害\n【 <color=#99ffff>冰元素</color> + <color=#80c0ff>水元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>凍結</color> ：本傷害+1，使目標本回合無法行動（受到物理或火元素傷害後提前解除，但是傷害+2）"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "規則解釋",
        "title": "規則解釋",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/01/21/84496276/07bae546ac7c69ef6402170b283840c5_8528436160276860675.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffffff>物理傷害</color>\n物理傷害不會附著元素，也不會發生元素反應。\n<color=#ffffff>持續回合</color>\n每回合結束階段， <color=#ffffff>持續回合</color> -1；\n<color=#ffffff>持續回合</color> 耗盡後，立刻棄置此牌。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      }
